{{- /*
SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
Copyright Noble Factor. All rights reserved.

amendment.md.template: the line a change to a schedule's steps writes at the end of its Schedule issue's Amendments
section (section 8 of the issue data model, question 4, ruled 2026-11-11): the date, who ran the command, what was
added or taken off at which step, the steps that moved, and why. Rendered by steps.star's amendment with star's
template module; its whitespace is folded to single spaces and the line wrapped at 120 columns after.

  .date, .login, .reason   strings
  .added                   steps added: {step, type, issue, title}
  .taken                   steps taken off: {step, type, issue, title, to}, to the schedule or project it went to
  .moved                   the steps that moved, or none: {first, last, by, direction, to_first, to_last};
                           by is 0 when they did not all move alike
*/ -}}
- {{.date}}, by {{.login}}:
{{- range $i, $a := .added}}{{if $i}};{{end}} step {{$a.step}} was added, {{$a.type}} {{$a.issue}}, {{$a.title}}{{end}}
{{- range $i, $t := .taken}}{{if or $i $.added}};{{end}} step {{$t.step}}, {{$t.type}} {{$t.issue}}, {{$t.title}}, was taken off
{{- if $t.to}}, for {{$t.to}}{{end}}{{end}}.
{{- with .moved}}
{{- if eq .first .last}} Step {{.first}} moved {{.direction}} {{.by}}, to {{.to_first}}.
{{- else if .by}} Steps {{.first}} to {{.last}} moved {{.direction}} {{.by}}, to {{.to_first}} to {{.to_last}}.
{{- else}} Steps {{.first}} to {{.last}} were renumbered {{.to_first}} to {{.to_last}}.{{end}}
{{- end}} {{.reason}}
